# Only what server/Dockerfile needs: root package files, shared/, server/ and client/package.json
# (the lock file covers all workspaces). Keeps game files, builds and secrets out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/release
.git
.github
Resources
devlib
devdata
docs
examples
client/*
!client/package.json
server/data
server/database
server/saves
server/library
server/test
**/settings.yaml
igdb.txt
*.log
